    // extension paths from the user settings are repeated here, plus:
    //   - C:\SysGCC\arm-eabi\bin  : arm-none-eabi-gcc / g++ / gdb
    //   - VS2022 bundled CMake + Ninja : required by the "Ninja" generator in CMakePresets.json
